      "username": "FrivYeti",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/{size}/1919_2.png",
      "created_at": "2022-09-28T14:50:17.420Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint for me!</p>\n<p>Between Sky-Scraper and Writhe, a lot of tools to make villains hurt themselves, which is the opposite of what Greazer wants to deal with. I focus-fired Ambuscade down right off the bat, then used Compulsion Canisters to make Glamour repeatedly blast Greazer’s hair and get wiped out. Once Greazer was down, I turned my attention to Hammer and Anvil, beating them unconscious, while using Writhe to redirect Proletariat’s largest melee hits back to his allies.</p>\n<p>No one down, although Legacy and Sky-Scraper both briefly dropped below 10.</p>",
