      "created_at": "2022-09-28T23:17:17.252Z",
      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/f/fccd69339ca9759078f4658fbf2025541e8363c1.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/fccd69339ca9759078f4658fbf2025541e8363c1\" title=\"Screenshot_20220928-181307\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/fccd69339ca9759078f4658fbf2025541e8363c1_2_225x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot_20220928-181307\" data-base62-sha1=\"A4opDnBHEAzE2C7tqHbXGXMftFT\" width=\"225\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/fccd69339ca9759078f4658fbf2025541e8363c1_2_225x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/fccd69339ca9759078f4658fbf2025541e8363c1_2_337x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/fccd69339ca9759078f4658fbf2025541e8363c1_2_450x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/fccd69339ca9759078f4658fbf2025541e8363c1_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_20220928-181307</span><span class=\"informations\">720×1600 108 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Was still a struggle the second time; came very close to losing Akash, and Writhe really got screwed by Glamour while using Darkly Dreaming to wipe out Proletariat, but finally the last two Slaughterhouse Sixers weren’t enough to keep Greazer from bailing.</p>",
